.Dd April 14, 2026
.Dt PODCAST-MGR.ISO10007 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm podcast-mgr.iso10007
.Nd configuration management plan per ISO 10007:2003
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This document defines the configuration management
.Pq CM
plan for
.Nm podcast-mgr
in accordance with ISO 10007:2003
.Em Quality management systems \(em Guidelines for configuration management .
.Sh SCOPE
CM applies to all files in the
.Nm podcast-mgr
repository from the first tagged release onward.
The CM authority is the sole project owner,
.An Dwight Spencer Aq Mt denzuko@dapla.net .
.Sh CONFIGURATION ITEMS
A configuration item
.Pq CI
is any artifact whose change must be tracked, reviewed, and recorded.
.Pp
.Bl -column "podcast_mgr.sarif" "Security" "Regenerate before release" -compact
.It Sy Item Ta Sy Class Ta Sy Change rule
.It Pa main.c Ta Source Ta CODEOWNERS review + linear history
.It Pa sandbox.h Ta Source Ta CODEOWNERS review + linear history
.It Pa nob.c Ta Build Ta CODEOWNERS review
.It Pa podcast.sh Ta Source Ta CODEOWNERS review + linear history
.It Pa feeds.xsd Ta Schema Ta Both CGI and script owners review
.It Pa index.cgi.8 Ta Documentation Ta Update with any interface change
.It Pa sbom.json Ta Security Ta Regenerate on each release
.It Pa podcast_mgr.sarif Ta Security Ta Regenerate on each release
.It Pa CHANGELOG.md Ta Record Ta Update before tagging
.El
.Sh IDENTIFICATION
.Ss Version Identification
Versions are identified by Git tag in the form
.Sy vMAJOR.MINOR
.Pq e.g., Sy v1.0 .
Tags are annotated objects pushed to origin; the tag message records
the release summary.
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width "MAJOR" -compact
.It Sy MAJOR
Incremented on breaking changes to
.Pa feeds.xml
schema, route interface, or sandbox API.
.It Sy MINOR
Incremented on backward-compatible additions or fixes.
.El
.Ss Item Identification
Each configuration item is identified by its repository path relative
to the root.
The authoritative revision of any item is its content at the current
release tag on the
.Sy main
branch.
.Ss Baseline
The baseline for version 1.0 is commit
.Sy 36fb707
tagged
.Sy v1.0
on 2026-04-14.
The baseline is immutable; subsequent changes require a new tag.
.Sh CHANGE CONTROL
.Ss Process
.Bl -enum
.It
Changes are proposed as Git commits on a branch.
.It
The
.Sy CODEOWNERS
file assigns review authority to
.Em @denzuko
for all paths.
.It
Branch protection on
.Sy main
requires:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
One approving review from a code owner.
.It
Stale review dismissal on new commits.
.It
No force-push.
.It
Linear history
.Pq no merge commits .
.It
Conversation resolution before merge.
.El
.It
After merge, a new tag is created if the change warrants a release.
Security artifact regeneration
.Pq Nm sbom.json , Nm podcast_mgr.sarif
is required before tagging.
.El
.Ss Emergency Changes
The single-owner model means the owner may commit directly to
.Sy main
for critical fixes, bypassing review.
Any such commit shall be documented in
.Pa CHANGELOG.md
under the next release with the note
.Dq "emergency fix \(em bypassed review" .
.Sh STATUS ACCOUNTING
The current status of all configuration items is recorded by:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Git commit history
.Pq Ic git log
for change chronology.
.It
Git tags
.Pq Ic git tag -l
for release baselines.
.It
.Pa CHANGELOG.md
for human-readable change summaries.
.It
.Pa sbom.json
for the current component inventory.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION AUDITS
.Ss Functional Configuration Audit
Performed before each release tag.
Confirms that:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
.Nm index.cgi
builds from
.Nm nob.c
without error.
.It
cppcheck reports zero findings.
.It
OSV CVE scan reports zero findings.
.It
.Pa sbom.json
and
.Pa podcast_mgr.sarif
reflect the current source.
.It
.Pa CHANGELOG.md
documents all changes since the previous tag.
.El
.Ss Physical Configuration Audit
Confirms that the tagged commit contains exactly the files listed in
the
.Sx CONFIGURATION ITEMS
table and no others outside
.Pa .githooks/
and
.Pa .gitignore .
.Sh TOOLS
.Bl -tag -width "mandoc"
.It Xr git 1
Version control, branching, tagging.
.It Nm gh
GitHub CLI for repository management, branch protection, release
creation.
.It Nm cdxgen
CycloneDX SBOM generation.
.It Nm cppcheck
Static analysis; produces SARIF input.
.It Nm mandoc
Manpage rendering and lint.
.El
